WEBVTT

00:07:28.772 --> 00:07:30.845
They're all exclamation points.

00:07:30.869 --> 00:07:33.914
But under the pizza
model, they're questions.

00:07:33.938 --> 00:07:35.796
And who gets to answer those questions?

00:07:35.820 --> 00:07:39.456
You do. I do.

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:41.356
So remember, when we're thinking about

00:07:41.380 --> 00:07:44.102
sexuality education and sexual activity,

00:07:44.126 --> 00:07:46.292
baseball, you're out.

00:07:46.316 --> 00:07:49.524
Pizza is the way to think about healthy,

00:07:49.548 --> 00:07:51.964
satisfying sexual activity,

00:07:51.988 --> 00:07:54.904
and good, comprehensive
sexuality education.

00:07:54.928 --> 00:07:57.134
Thank you very much for your time.

00:07:57.158 --> 00:08:01.820
(Applause)